ction assumes a full healthy season."},"4427366":{"tone":"warn","short":"committee","note":"Mid-August groin injury plus the coach wants a three-back committee. Volume case is weaker than the projection."},"4870808":{"tone":"warn","short":"high ankle","note":"High ankle sprain, out for preseason, team only hoping for Week 1. High ankles linger."},"3040151":{"tone":"warn","short":"Achilles return","note":"Activated from PUP Aug 23, racing back from a torn Achilles with no preseason reps. An age-33 TE on an Achilles is an early-season floor risk, not a season-ender - but temper the first month."},"5083076":{"tone":"warn","short":"QB change","note":"Falling after the Browns named Deshaun Watson starter."},"3045147":{"tone":"warn","short":"IR foot","note":"Placed on IR Aug 29 (foot) with a return designation - out at least the first 4 games. Undraftable in a 3-bench league."},"3117251":{"tone":"warn","short":"questionable","note":"Questionable; missed over a week with tightness the team is managing. Long injury history."},"4685278":{"tone":"warn","short":"groin","note":"Missed preseason with a groin injury. Risky at ADP - Rome Odunze benefits."},"3043078":{"tone":"warn","short":"age 32","note":"Age-32 season. No RB since 2000 has averaged 16 ppg at 32+, only three managed 14. Volume is safe, efficiency is the risk."},"4567048":{"tone":"good","short":"bell cow","note":"Zach Charbonnet tore his ACL in January - Walker owns the entire KC backfield. Market has not fully repriced this. Best value on our board."},"4361579":{"tone":"good","short":"bell cow","note":"Re-signed by Dallas, projected for genuine workhorse volume (~1,280 rush yds, 15 total TD)."},"4890973":{"tone":"good","short":"300+ touches","note":"Kubiak wide-zone scheme fits him; staff targeting 300-335 touches plus a bigger passing role. Rookie-year letdown is your discount."},"4362628":{"tone":"good","short":"cleared","note":"Aug 25 knee scare was a minor hyperextension; said he could play the next day. Held 